cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software repository and the associated study when using the code,
  checkpoints, or their outputs in public research outputs, as required by LICENSE.
  The study is currently a manuscript under review. Its citation is listed under
  references; no publication DOI has been assigned in this file.
type: software
title: "LC50 prediction with FiLM-Concatenation fusion"
